_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNjE5NTg5Ng==","user":{"login":"dcdh","id":5189615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxODk2MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5189615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh","html_url":"https://github.com/dcdh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-25T19:07:12Z","updated_at":"2020-10-25T19:17:22Z","body":"I found another classpath issue.\r\n\r\nWhen I am using `keycloak-admin-client` likes this:\r\n\r\n```xml\r\n        <dependency>\r\n            <groupId>org.keycloak</groupId>\r\n            <artifactId>keycloak-admin-client</artifactId>\r\n        </dependency>\r\n```\r\n\r\nI need to downgrade a dependency - by declaring it in my pom.xml - to the same version used in 1.8.3.Final version of Quarkus:\r\n\r\n```xml\r\n        <dependency>\r\n            <groupId>org.jboss.resteasy</groupId>\r\n            <artifactId>resteasy-jackson2-provider</artifactId>\r\n            <version>4.5.6.Final</version>\r\n        </dependency>\r\n```\r\nHowever, I've got this error:\r\n\r\n```\r\njava.lang.NoSuchMethodError: 'com.google.common.base.Equivalence com.github.fge.jackson.JsonNumEquals.getInstance()'\r\n```\r\nbecause `keycloak-admin-client` rely on jackson and it clashes with the version of `json-schema-validator`\r\n\r\nThe main change is the dependency of  `json-patch` given by the version of `resteasy-jackson2-provider`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/716195896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dcdh","id":5189615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxODk2MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5189615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh","html_url":"https://github.com/dcdh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcdh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","